# Machine-local tooling state — never committed.
# Claude Code writes per-machine preferences here (the .local.json suffix is
# the convention for "this file is not shared"); GSD writes runtime sentinels
# under .gsd/. Both are derived from the local environment, so committing them
# would push one machine's setup onto every other checkout.
.claude/settings.local.json
.gsd/

# Live agent worktrees created by the harness during parallel plan execution.
# These are full checkouts of this repo; committing them would nest the tree
# inside itself. They are transient and removed when their agent finishes.
.claude/worktrees/
